ont style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:190%">(3)</font><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:190%">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;JEFFREY SMITH</font><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:190%">&#160;(&#8220;Continuing Party&#8221;).</font></div><div style="text-align:justify"><font><br></font></div><div style="text-align:justify"><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:190%">WHEREAS&#58;</font></div><div style="text-align:justify"><font><br></font></div><div style="padding-left:36.85pt;text-indent:-36.85pt"><font style="color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:190%">A.</font><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:190%;padding-left:26.47pt">The Assignor and Continuing Party entered into that certain Consultancy Agreement dated January 31, 2026 (the &#8220;Original Contract&#8221;).</font></div><div style="padding-left:36.85pt;text-indent:-36.85pt"><font style="color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:190%">B.</font><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:190%;padding-left:26.47pt">The Assignor wishes to assign all its rights and transfer all its obligations under the Original Contract to the Assignee.</font></div><div style="padding-left:36.85pt;text-indent:-36.85pt"><font style="color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:190%">C.</font><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0a0a0a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-siz